Begin Material

Material White

Prop diffuseColor RGB 0.725 0.71 0.68

Material Glass 3

Prop absorbed RGB 1 1 1 
Prop ior Float 1.5
Prop ShaderType Int 3

Material Steel 5

Prop diffuseColor RGB 0.2 0.2 0.2
Prop specularColor RGB 0.9 0.9 0.9
Prop shininess Float 128
Prop ambientColor RGB 0.05 0.05 0.05
Prop F0 Float 0.99

End

Begin Model

Model Sphere
Translation -100 0 800

Sphere Sphere Glass
N 0 0 1
P 0 0 0
R 50

End

